{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddPersistence"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"Add Persistence","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Related-Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddICloudSync","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStoreGuide","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/MacrosReference"],"title":"Related Documentation"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAPaywall","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAVersionKillswitch","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAParentalGate","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAnalytics","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddFeatureFlags","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToCancelEffects","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddICloudSync","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/BuildingADomainPlugin","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/AgentSkill"],"title":"How-to Guides","anchor":"How-to-Guides"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Persist your domain entities to SwiftData with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxPersistence"},{"type":"text","text":" plugin and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Persisted"},{"type":"text","text":" macro — no hand-written "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Model"},{"type":"text","text":" classes, database actors, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StateWriter"},{"type":"text","text":" closures."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux"]]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxPersistence"},{"type":"text","text":" tu